{"id":"n15955-1-8","stage":2,"title":"시각 · 时刻","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15955-1-8-1","ko":"저 잠시 밖에 좀 나갔다 올게요.","zh":"我出去一会儿就回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"잠시","meaning":"暂时，一会儿","explanation":"잠시：暂时，一会儿","readings":[{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26895","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}},{"text":"밖에","meaning":"外面，外边","explanation":"밖：外面，外边；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"4","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밖에","audio":"/audio/b49faf879a59fe63a605.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一会儿","explanation":"좀：一会儿","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"2","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"나갔다","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나갔다","audio":"/audio/4474ae87d501bfa3b579.mp3"}},{"text":"올게요.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올게요","audio":"/audio/65fee9486bc51beeb1c3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"6fcdfa8c124ab5cb","term":"잠시","zh":"暂时，一会儿","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3","entryId":"26895","definition":"在很短的时间之内。","pronunciation":["잠ː시"]},{"id":"c54dd45d274b6e46","term":"밖","zh":"外面，外边","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3","entryId":"17878","definition":"不被某个包围的空间。","pronunciation":["박"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一会儿","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"时间短暂地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"因有目的而去某处。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/29587448b25c172aeb25.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15955-1-8-2","ko":"이렇게 늦은 시각에 어디를 가려는 거니?","zh":"这么晚了，你打算去哪儿？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"늦은","meaning":"晚，迟","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64526","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦은","audio":"/audio/07315af9b0cb8808b4f0.mp3"}},{"text":"시각에","meaning":"时刻，时候","explanation":"시각：时刻，时候；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시각","audio":"/audio/faea4ccff05881ea0287.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15955","senseId":"1","lemma":"시각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시각에","audio":"/audio/d591d72f40e2569bb5e8.mp3"}},{"text":"어디를","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디를","audio":"/audio/30dd6318827dd406d486.mp3"}},{"text":"가려는","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；려는：表示正打算或意图做某事，修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가려는","audio":"/audio/04bfa4c52c033bfb65b1.mp3"}},{"text":"거니?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거니","audio":"/audio/3e0100c9477501692d3f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"64526","definition":"比作为基准的某个时候还慢。","pronunciation":["늗따"]},{"id":"faea4ccff05881ea","term":"시각","zh":"时刻，时候","audio":"/audio/faea4ccff05881ea0287.mp3","entryId":"15955","definition":"连续的时间中的某一个点。","pronunciation":["시각"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方